flowchart TD
  Change[Code or docs change] --> PR[Reviewable PR or protected main]
  PR --> CI[GitHub Actions]
  CI --> Check[Build, tests, secret scan]
  Check --> Risk{Production impact?}
  Risk -->|No| Deploy[Deploy preview or staging]
  Risk -->|Yes| Approval[Protected environment approval]
  Approval --> Backup[Snapshot or backup]
  Backup --> DeployProd[Production deploy]
  DeployProd --> Audit[Audit logs and rollback notes]
